WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.285 --> 00:00:02.993
- [Subhi] I am Subhi Nahas.

00:00:02.993 --> 00:00:05.910
I am a Syrian gay refugee activist.

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:10.882
Before the war, it was not safe at all

00:00:10.882 --> 00:00:12.852
for me to walk around.

00:00:12.852 --> 00:00:16.057
Al Qaeda come into my hometown,
and they said they will

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:20.224
apply Sharia law and cleanse
the city of all, like, sodomites.

00:00:21.859 --> 00:00:26.026
I expected to immigrate, I
did not expect to run away.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:34.687
I am an advocate for LGBT
and LGBT refugees' rights.

00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:39.150
When I went out from my country,

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:42.480
I found that the peace of mind

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.826
and the safety that I felt,

00:00:44.826 --> 00:00:47.012
I wanted everybody else to feel the same,

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:49.429
and I want them to feel, like, safe.

00:00:51.038 --> 00:00:54.535
Syrian LGBT face double discrimination.

00:00:54.535 --> 00:00:56.396
You escaped to save your life;

00:00:56.396 --> 00:00:58.841
you escaped your family rejection;

00:00:58.841 --> 00:01:01.508
and then to find your true self.

00:01:03.378 --> 00:01:06.919
It is difficult to really live your life,

00:01:06.919 --> 00:01:09.169
but sometimes it's healing.

00:01:10.078 --> 00:01:13.827
You start to realize how bad things were,

00:01:13.827 --> 00:01:17.160
and how good they will be in the future.

00:01:19.307 --> 00:01:22.224
The Castro is a place where you can

00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:25.236
be whatever you wanna be.

00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:30.462
It may give you this courage
to come out to yourself,

00:01:30.462 --> 00:01:33.063
and be who you wanna be,

00:01:33.063 --> 00:01:36.989
and the person that you're supposed to be.

00:01:36.989 --> 00:01:40.064
I always thought that home is a location,

00:01:40.064 --> 00:01:44.231
but home is where your friends
are, where your love is.

00:01:45.922 --> 00:01:48.997
If home is not that, then I don't think

00:01:48.997 --> 00:01:50.997
I'll find it anywhere else.

